From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: k230: add c908 cpu support files

Add the CPU support files for the K230 XuanTie C908 core: cache
maintenance, the system controller interface and register map, the
scripts that convert DDR training register sequences into C init
tables, and a driver for the hardware gzip decompressor (UGZIP).
k230_compat.h carries the definitions that the K230 board and SoC code
is built with.

Upstream-Status: Pending
